OL,3,GNEWSAThousands expected at town's half
OL,4,Amarathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthampton is gearing up to welcome
OL,7,Fhundreds of runners to its annual half
OL,8,Fmarathon.
OL,10,FThe Amazing Northampton Run takes place
OL,11,Fon Sunday and last year it attracted a
OL,12,Frecord 1,700 competitors.
OL,14,FThis will be the fourth time it has
OL,15,Ftaken place and the 13.1-mile (21.1km)
OL,16,Floop starts and finishes in the Market
OL,17,FSquare, taking in The Guildhall and
OL,18,FFranklin's Gardens along the route.
OL,20,FAs well as the half marathon, there is
OL,21,Fa relay race and a 5km (3.1-mile) fun
OL,22,Frun on the day.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
